<title>AUSTRALIA: Rugby League-Walters signs for Adelaide Rams.</title>
<headline>Rugby League-Walters signs for Adelaide Rams.</headline>
<dateline>ADELAIDE 1996-10-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>Former Australia rugby league hooker Kerrod Walters has left Brisbane Broncos to join the fledgling Super League club, Adelaide Rams.</p>
<p>Walters has signed a two-year contract with Adelaide, club officials said.</p>
<p>The Rams will make their debut next year when media baron Rupert Murdoch launches his breakaway Super League in Australia.</p>
<p>--Sydney Newsroom 61-2 9373 1800</p>
</text>
